{"id":"n72140-1-11","stage":1,"title":"출발 · 出发","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n72140-1-11-1","ko":"약속 장소에 언제까지 올 수 있어?","zh":"你最晚什么时候能到约定地点？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"약속","meaning":"约定，约好，承诺","explanation":"약속：约定，约好，承诺","readings":[{"term":"약속","audio":"/audio/a39ee87db456831ef069.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36695","senseId":"1","lemma":"약속","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"장소에","meaning":"场所，地点","explanation":"장소：场所，地点；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"장소","audio":"/audio/61eaecc09cb7e53dbc6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30185","senseId":"1","lemma":"장소","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"언제까지","meaning":"什么时候","explanation":"언제：什么时候；까지：表示终点或范围：“到、直到、连……都”。","readings":[{"term":"언제","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17856","senseId":"1","lemma":"언제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"올","meaning":"到","explanation":"오다：到；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"15","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"수","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있어?","meaning":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","explanation":"있다：能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"5","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"a39ee87db456831e","term":"약속","zh":"约定，约好，承诺","audio":"/audio/a39ee87db456831ef069.mp3","entryId":"36695","definition":"事先决定与他人一起做某事；或指那样定下的内容。","pronunciation":["약쏙"]},{"id":"61eaecc09cb7e53d","term":"장소","zh":"场所，地点","audio":"/audio/61eaecc09cb7e53dbc6e.mp3","entryId":"30185","definition":"某事发生的地方；或指进行某事的地方。","pronunciation":["장소"]},{"id":"25f9ca42793d0a69","term":"언제","zh":"什么时候","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3","entryId":"17856","definition":"在不知道的某个时间。","pronunciation":["언ː제"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"到达某个时间或时期。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/1b04f55d36e8d23f5a2e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n72140-1-11-2","ko":"미안해. 아직 집에서 출발도 못 했어.","zh":"对不起，我还没从家里出发呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"미안해.","meaning":"抱歉，对不起，不好意思","explanation":"미안하다：抱歉，对不起，不好意思；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"미안하다","audio":"/audio/a3bb8e6d52d6985107bb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67883","senseId":"2","lemma":"미안하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아직","meaning":"尚未，还，仍然","explanation":"아직：尚未，还，仍然","readings":[{"term":"아직","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71254","senseId":"1","lemma":"아직","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"집에서","meaning":"家","explanation":"집：家；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"3","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"출발도","meaning":"出发","explanation":"출발：出发；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"출발","audio":"/audio/c92d127244fd943f6a04.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72140","senseId":"1","lemma":"출발","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"못","meaning":"不会做动词所指的动作。","explanation":"못：不会做动词所指的动作。","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"했어.","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"a3bb8e6d52d69851","term":"미안하다","zh":"抱歉，对不起，不好意思","audio":"/audio/a3bb8e6d52d6985107bb.mp3","entryId":"67883","definition":"谦虚地向对方请求谅解。","pronunciation":["미안하다"]},{"id":"fc3d924ec6725c21","term":"아직","zh":"尚未，还，仍然","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3","entryId":"71254","definition":"表示某事或状态成为怎么样需要过一段时间， 或者某事或状态不结束继续不断。","pronunciation":["아직"]},{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"组成家庭而生活的一家子。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"c92d127244fd943f","term":"출발","zh":"出发","audio":"/audio/c92d127244fd943f6a04.mp3","entryId":"72140","definition":"离开原地向某处去。","pronunciation":["출발"]},{"id":"89058d16546c1107","term":"못","zh":"不会做动词所指的动作。","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"不会做动词所指的动作。","pronunciation":["몯ː"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/16a568f5f3cccb106104.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.485,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=72140","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":46,"sequenceScore":2.0826,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你最晚什么时候能到约定地点？","对不起，我还没从家里出发呢。","请诚实地回答我们提出的问题！"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你最晚什么时候能到约定地点？","对不起，我还没从家里出发呢。","请诚实地回答我们提出的问题！"],"answer":1}]}
